  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/page/Category:Head_items\" title=\"Category:Head items\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_ItemSlot_Head.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure> \n<h2><span id=\"Renard.27s_Elegant_Hat\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Renard's_Elegant_Hat\">Renard's Elegant Hat</span></h2>\n<table class=\"striped\" style=\"clear: right; border: 1px #DDAAFF solid; margin: 4px; width: 100%; --bg-color-1:#DDA0DD;--bg-color-1-dark:#773777;--bg-color-2:#EEDDFF;--bg-color-2-dark:#3A2F45;--header-color:#DDA0DD;--header-color-dark:#773777;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\" width=\"15%\">Minimum level\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\" width=\"42.5%\">18\n</td>\n<th rowspan=\"11\" class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\" width=\"42.5%\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Renard%27s_Elegant_Hat_shown.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Renard%27s_Elegant_Hat_shown.jpg/420px-Renard%27s_Elegant_Hat_shown.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"232\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Renard%27s_Elegant_Hat_shown.jpg/630px-Renard%27s_Elegant_Hat_shown.jpg 1.5x, https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Renard%27s_Elegant_Hat_shown.jpg/840px-Renard%27s_Elegant_Hat_shown.jpg 2x\" /></a></span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Item Type\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">Clothing / Helm\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\"><a href=\"/page/Slot\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Slot\">Slot</a>\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">Head\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Race Absolutely Required\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><a href=\"/page/None\" title=\"None\">None</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Binding\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><a href=\"/page/Bind\" title=\"Bind\">Bound to Character&#160;on Acquire</a>, <a href=\"/page/Exclusive\" title=\"Exclusive\">Exclusive</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Durability\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">110\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Material\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r705484\">.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip{cursor:pointer;position:relative}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip.no-icon{border-bottom:1px dashed #999999}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip>span.popup.tooltip{background-color:#EEEEEE;background-color:var(--background-color-neutral,#EEEEEE);border:1px solid #333333;border-radius:3px;box-shadow:3px 5px 10px;color:#202122;color:var(--color-base,#202122);cursor:text;display:none;margin:0px;max-width:500px;padding:5px;width:250px;z-index:10000}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.narrow{width:100px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.fill{padding:5px 12px;width:max-content}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.wide{width:450px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.custom{max-width:80vw}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip{display:block;position:absolute}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.above{bottom:100%;top:auto;margin-bottom:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.middle{bottom:auto;top:50%;margin-top:-1em}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.below{bottom:auto;top:100%;margin-top:5px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.left{left:0px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center{left:50%;margin-left:-125px;right:auto}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.narrow{margin-left:-50px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.fill{left:-262px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;right:-262px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.center.wide{margin-left:-225px}.mw-parser-output span.popup.has_tooltip:hover>span.popup.tooltip.right{left:auto;right:0px}</style><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Leather\" title=\"Leather\">Leather</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Leather\" title=\"Leather\">Leather</a>:</b> <b>Leather</b> armor is made of the hide of animals. It provides decent protection without excessively restricting the user's movements.</span></span> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Hardness\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">15\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF; width: 150px;\">Base Value\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; width: 450px;\"><span style=\"display: none;\">0010005000</span>10,005<span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\">pp<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"/page/Currency\" title=\"Currency\">Platinum Piece</a></span></span>&#160;\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">0.10 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Wrath_of_the_Flame\" title=\"Wrath of the Flame\">Wrath of the Flame</a></b>, End chest\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Enchantments\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Feather_Falling\" title=\"Feather Falling\">Feather Falling</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Feather_Falling\" title=\"Feather Falling\">Feather Falling</a>:</b> This item is engraved with feathers and bestows a powerful magical effect. Whenever the wearer begins to fall from any height, this effect slows the descent dramatically, causing the wearer to fall like a feather.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Underwater_Action\" title=\"Underwater Action\">Underwater Action</a> <span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Underwater_Action\" title=\"Underwater Action\">Underwater Action</a>:</b> This item grants the wearer the ability to breathe water as if it were air.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Whirlwind_Absorption\" title=\"Whirlwind Absorption\">Whirlwind Absorption</a> - 25 Charges (Recharged/Day:  10)<span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Whirlwind_Absorption\" title=\"Whirlwind Absorption\">Whirlwind Absorption</a>:</b> This effect absorbs air elementals knockdown attack.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Renard%27s_Elegant_Hat.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Renard%27s_Elegant_Hat.png/420px-Renard%27s_Elegant_Hat.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"396\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Renard%27s_Elegant_Hat.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#DDAAFF\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EEDDFF\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\"><i>This jaunty hat was once owned by Renard Lyrandar, a famous airship captian. This once influential member of house Lyrandar was lost when his ship disappeared several decades ago, never to be heard from again.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color: #DDAAFF;\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color: #EEDDFF;\">\n<p>This item's description misspells 'captain' as 'captian.'\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817060414\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.093 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.133 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2682/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 19624/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5385/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n122.84%  137.408     38 Template:IO\n100.00%  111.860      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  111.860      1 -total\n 96.48%  107.918      1 Template:Named_Clothing\n 41.11%   45.980      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 39.97%   44.710      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 38.76%   43.354      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 37.48%   41.929      2 Template:InCategory\n 27.02%   30.229      5 Template:Popup\n 24.56%   27.477      1 Template:Mat\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:11862-0!canonical and timestamp 20260817060414 and revision id 634184. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"
